[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、先日行われた中間試験の結果を返却するわ。\n順番に呼ぶから、首を洗って待っていなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Today, I'll be issuing your midterm exam results. You'll be called up individually, so please wait until I call your name."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――次。レスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next up, Resna Sternenlicht."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……合格よ。最初のテストに比べると\n随分点数が上がったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You passed. Your score has improved quite a bit compared to your first test."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほっ……よかったあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... thank goodness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ、お世辞にもいい結果とは言えない。\n油断してると期末試験で落ちるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I wouldn't exactly call these good results. Should you let up, you won't pass the final examination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "が、頑張ります……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'll do my best..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次。ミミ・ウリエ・フォン・シュヴァルツラング",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next. Mimi Houllier von Schwarzlang."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Present."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sigh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（華やかな文化祭が終わり――\n\u3000学園の生徒たちは普段の生活に戻りつつあった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(With the lively cultural festival behind us, the students are returning to their normal routines.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あと、今期の大きな行事と言えば、期末に控えている\n\u3000試験と錬金術部の対抗戦……くらいかな？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The only major events left this term are the final exams and the Alchemy Club competition, I think?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうだったの？\u3000試験結果",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How did you do on the exam?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぼちぼちかな。一応、平均点は超えられたよ。\nミミちゃんは？\u3000今回も満点？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not too bad, I guess. At least I scored above average. What about you, Mimi? Another perfect score?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一科目だけ逃したわ。文化祭で時間を取られた分、\n準備が足りなかったわね……言い訳にはできないけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I missed one subject. The cultural festival took up so much time that I couldn't prepare well enough... though that's no excuse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも十分すごいよ！\u3000私も頑張らなきゃなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's still amazing! I need to work harder too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次。ライザリン・シュタウト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next. Reisalin Stout."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうしたのかしら？\u3000この点数は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How did this happen? This score..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トイレで全部出てしまって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a wash..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "？\u3000よく分からないけれど、次はもっと頑張りなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not sure what you mean by that, but you absolutely need to try harder next time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次。ユナ・ヴァイツ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next. Juna Waitz."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Present."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "全教科満点よ。文句なし。不正を疑うレベルね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You managed perfect scores in every subject. These are flawless results... To the point of suspicision, really."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、そのようなことは決して……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I would never resort to underhanded means..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってる、冗談よ。この調子で次も頑張りなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, it was a joke. Keep up the good work!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナ先輩、すごい……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, Miss Juna is amazing...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実行委員の仕事で私たち以上に忙しかったはずなのに、\nさすが、学園一の優等生と言われるだけあるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even though she was busier than us with the committee work... she really lives up to her name as the academy's top student."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……と、いうわけで。中間試験は全員合格点よ。\nマリオン先生がいない間に落第者が出なくて何よりね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems that everyone passed the midterms. I'm glad no one failed with Professor Marion on leave."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、今日の授業はこれで終わりだけれど……放課後、\n生徒会選挙の立候補者向け説明会があるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This marks the end of today's class, but there's an information session after school for student council election candidates."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（生徒会選挙……！\u3000そういえばそれもあった！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The student council election...! That's right, that's coming up too!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "立候補を考えている人は参加すること。\nまあ、研究オタク揃いの錬金術科にそんな生徒は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyone considering running should attend. Though I doubt there are many such students in the Alchemy Department, which is filled with only those with passion for alchemy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――いや、一人いたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, what do we have here. It seems we do have one student keen on it after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ユナ先輩、生徒会長を目指してるんだよね。\n\u3000同じ錬金術科として、応援しなきゃ！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's right, Juna is aiming to become student council president. As a fellow alchemy student, I should cheer her on!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]